  "category": "beach",
  "positioning": "Italian Renaissance-style oceanfront resort in Palm Beach, founded by Henry Morrison Flagler and still owned by his heirs",
  "best_for": [
    "Golfers who want Florida's oldest course on site",
    "Families who want a beach club with several pools and kids' activities",
